OL,3,GNEWSADumpling squishies safety warning
OL,4,Aissued
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to check before
OL,7,Fbuying "squishy dumpling toys" because
OL,8,Fof their potential dangerousness,
OL,9,FTrading Standards warns.
OL,11,FOfficials issued a warning over the
OL,12,Fsensory toys, shaped like bao buns,
OL,13,Fwhich have become increasingly popular
OL,14,Fwith children.
OL,16,FCornwall Trading Standards said some
OL,17,Fmanufacturers producing the toys did
OL,18,Fnot meet the required safety standards
OL,19,Fand said people should check for the
OL,20,FUKCA or CE safety markings when buying
OL,21,Fand to throw away any that had a strong
OL,22,Fchemical smell.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
