OL,3,GNEWSADumpling squishies safety warning
OL,4,Aissued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe department said counterfeit
OL,7,Fproducts could contain excessive levels
OL,8,Fof benzene - a toxic chemical which can
OL,9,Fcause drowsiness, dizziness, headaches
OL,10,Fand irritation to the eyes, nose and
OL,11,Fthroat.
